# Transcripted anonymous-analytics event allowlist - single source of truth.
#
# Format: one event per line, "event_name|prop_a,prop_b,...". Properties are a
# comma-separated, sorted set; an empty allowlist is written "event_name|".
#
# AnalyticsEventPolicy compiles this file at runtime; the privacy taxonomy doc
# and ops scripts mirror it. It is marked `merge=union` in .gitattributes so two
# telemetry PRs that each add a new event append independent lines and avoid
# colliding on a shared Swift dictionary anchor. After a union merge, run
#   python3 scripts/ops/normalize-analytics-taxonomy.py
# to re-sort/dedupe. Lines beginning with # are ignored.
# See docs/analytics-taxonomy-merge.md.
